        "value": "<p>A sand-shred hazard given teeth: a swarm of Tiny fey grit-motes riding the Bleach's coral-sand winds, sharp as ground glass. Cold damage, <em>gust of wind</em>, and shelter are the answers; swords are a prayer. One swarm in a Shred Gale is a Medium encounter with teeth; two swarms in the Grinder Heart is the wall-of-teeth moment.</p>",
